      "cooked": "<p>Debated necroing <a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/variant-unlock-agent-of-gloom-spite/13258\">this</a> thread, but created a new one instead.  I just beat Spite in a normal game, then played an advanced game against Gloomweaver which fulfilled all the unlock conditions for Agent of Gloom (relics all in trash, two Profane Zealots in play, I’m 98% sure there were no Voodoo Pins since I’d been consistently killing them and didn’t remember seeing one pop out in the last round).  I didn’t know exactly when variant unlocks pop up if they require a game victory, so when I got my “slide to continue”, I expected to see it soon… but nothing.</p>",
